==Trivia==
*The {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} print of this card cannot be received from packs, but is instead rewarded for completing the "Complete the Kanto Pokédex!" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]].
*This card's {{TCGP|immersive card|immersive}} illustration includes {{p|Metapod}}, {{p|Fearow}}, {{p|Dugtrio}}, {{p|Abra}}, {{p|Slowpoke}}, {{p|Magnemite}}, {{p|Gastly}}, {{p|Voltorb}}, {{p|Magikarp}}, {{p|Ditto}}, and {{p|Snorlax}}.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY Promo|Mew|192}}, one of the {{TCG|XY Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Psy Report''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Dark Explorers|Espeon|48}} from the {{TCG|Dark Explorers}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl}}.

